OL,4,BGloucestershire renamed Bristol Lions  
OL,5,Bfor T20 Blast                          
OL,6,GGloucestershire will rebrand as        
OL,7,GBristol Lions for the T20 Blast from   
OL,8,Gthe 2027 season.                       
OL,10,FThe club revealed their intentions     
OL,11,Fearlier this month to change their     
OL,12,Fidentity for the format to include     
OL,13,FBristol, the city where they play home 
OL,14,Fmatches at the Seat Unique Stadium, as 
OL,15,Fpart of a strategy to "reach a new     
OL,16,Faudience".                             
